DESCRIPTION:Duke Research in Engineering Program (DukeREP) is a 7-week sum
 mer program hosted by the Biomedical Engineering Department (BME) for hig
 h school students with an interest in science and engineering.\n\nApply h
 ere by February 15th: https://sites.duke.edu/dukerep/apply/\nRecommendati
 on letters are due by February 20th.\n\nEligibility criteria: Participant
 s must be a rising junior or rising senior in high school in Summer 2026 
 and be 16 years of age or older.\n\nWhile priority is given to Durham Pub
 lic School students\, we accept applications from all eligible high schoo
 l students in North Carolina. We are unfortunately not able to provide ac
 commodations for students outside of NC.\n\nPlease visit our website to l
 earn more:https://sites.duke.edu/dukerep/
DURATION:P1D
