DESCRIPTION:The Duke Center for Jewish Studies\, in connection with Depart
 ment of Asian and Middle Eastern Studies\, is proud to host the 2026 Nati
 onal Association of Professors of Hebrew Annual Conference.   Please note
  that this conference will take place online.\n\nThe Program Committee of
  the National Association of Professors of Hebrew (NAPH) invites proposal
 s for sessions or presentations on any aspect of scholarship or instructi
 on related to Hebrew language\, literature\, and culture. We welcome prop
 osals for individual papers as well as different types of panels: roundta
 ble panels (focused on a topical\, debatable issue)\; panels of brief pre
 sentations + one-hour discussion (focused on a specific topic in the cont
 ext of research)\; and organized panels of 20-minute presentations follow
 ed by discussion. All other panels\, including roundtables and other form
 ats\, are limited to 1.5 or 2 hours\, depending on the schedule. Presenta
 tions must be of original\, unpublished work that has not yet been publis
 hed or presented at an academic conference.
DURATION:P3D
DTSTAMP:20260416T175654Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260616
LAST-MODIFIED:20260416T175654Z
