DESCRIPTION:Led by Eric Chaiken\, LMCHC\, LCAS\, PAS Counselor\, this sess
 ion will delve into the peace that comes from releasing what no longer se
 rves us-whether it's past failures\, lingering regrets\, or burdens we've
  been carrying. Eric will introduce strategies for letting go and show ho
 w creating space for healing can open doors to growth and new possibiliti
 es.
DURATION:PT1H
