DESCRIPTION:Whether you're experienced in research or just getting started
 \, strong mentor relationships are powerful tools to further your academi
 c and professional goals. This workshop will focus not only on how to eff
 ectively communicate and align expectations with your research mentor\, b
 ut to also grow your relationship with your mentor and gain the most out 
 of your research experience. Learn about how students can connect with PI
 s\, bench mentors\, thesis advisors\, and more in this interactive worksh
 op.
DURATION:PT1H30M
