DESCRIPTION:A boundary-crossing program featuring some of the greats of th
 e 20th & 21st century American music. Music of Leonard Bernstein\, Bill E
 vans\, Joan Tower\, Derek Bermel & Scott Lindroth.\n\nPROGRAM\nLeonard Be
 rnstein: Clarinet Sonata\; Derek Bermel: Thracian Sketches for solo clari
 net\; Jamie Keesecker-Bill Evan: Peacocks for flute and strings\; Scott L
 indroth: Inner Voices for solo viola\; Joan Tower: White Granite for pian
 o and strings\n\nARTISTS\nJonathan Bagg\, viola\nLisa Emenheiser\, piano\
 nAri Streisfeld\, violin\nThomas Kraines\, cello\nDerek Bermel\, clarinet
 \nLaura Gilbert\, flute
DURATION:PT1H30M
